+13. **Release**: dated folder, fork tag, GitHub release, source patch verified, hygiene grep (B.5).
+14. **Second checkpoint**: `qad2-kda-w8a16-csf` declaration; W8A16 or BF16 KDA projection path; suite plus a 516K
