+Patches applied only to the b12x overlay (`tp3-tools/make-b12x-overlay.sh` -> `.b12x-overlay`, used by
+`glm53-export-tp3.sh` via `B12X_OVERLAY`), not to the shared `.venv` (which the DS41 exports also use).
+
